    {
      "id": "5b356a49-627a-498f-9b67-78eae9d8c3d9",
      "type": "manga",
      "attributes": {
        "title": {
          "ja-ro": "Mahouka Koukou no Rettousei - Yotsuba Keishou-hen 「Movie Promotion」"
        },
        "altTitles": [
          {
            "ja": "魔法科高校の劣等生 四葉継承編 「劇場版 宣伝」"
          },
          {
            "en": "The Irregular at Magic High School - Yotsuba Succession Arc 「Movie Promotion」"
          }
        ],
        "description": {
          "en": "Before the release of The Irregular at Magic High School - Yotsuba Succession Arc in theatres on Friday, May 8th, 2026, here is a manga compilation that lets you look back at the entire Mahouka anime series all at once!\n\nAs long as you read this, you’ll be able to enjoy the movie The Irregular at Magic High School: Yotsuba Succession Arc right away!\n\nLet’s take a look back at the Mahouka anime together with the Shiba siblings!",
          "ja": "この1冊で追いつける！\n魔法科高校の劣等生\n5月8日（金）公開の劇場版「魔法科高校の劣等生 四葉継承編」の前に\nこれまでのアニメ「魔法科」シリーズを一挙に振り返ることができる漫画コンテンツ。\nこれさえ読んでいればすぐに劇場版「魔法科高校の劣等生 四葉継承編」をお楽しみいただけます！\nあなたも司波兄妹と一緒にアニメ魔法科を振り返っていきましょう！！"
        },
